===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Roaring Skies|Jirachi|42}} from the {{TCG|Roaring Skies}} expansion.
*'''Star Drop''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Celestial Guardians|Minior|105}} from the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.

